# New experiments are source-only by default, including unknown result formats.
# A child .gitignore may explicitly allow a reviewed configuration file.
**/*
!**/
!**/.gitignore
!**/*.py
!**/*.pyw
!**/README.md

# Never admit generated code snapshots through the source allowlist.
**/outputs/
**/output/
**/results/
**/results_archive/
**/artifacts/
**/runs/
**/cache/
**/caches/
**/__pycache__/
**/.*/
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/logs/
**/data/
**/input/
**/inputs/
**/datasets/
**/annotations/
**/labels/
**/source_snapshot/
**/snapshots/
**/runtime/
**/models/
**/env/
**/venv/
